      "title": "Adjunct Faculty – Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Track",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty – Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Track Location Nashua Job Type Part-Time Job Number 202500237 Division Div of Nursing & Health Professions Department Nursing and Health Professions Opening Date 08/17/2026 Description Benefits Description Adjunct Faculty – Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Track Rivier University invites applications for the position of Adjunct Faculty in our low-residency Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Program. Reporting to the Dean of Nursing and Health Professions, the adjunct faculty member will prepare the graduate to practice and provide care to patient populations in the acute care environment, over the age of seventeen. Duties and Responsibilities Ability to engage in critical thinking and exercise independent judgment. Ability to maintain confidentiality and manage confidential information. Ability to collaborate with other faculty and staff and maintain collegial relations. Ability to communicate effectively in written and oral form, and Knowledge of and competence with a variety of computer applications including word-processing, online teaching and reporting platforms, as well as online calendaring and email. Qualifications Experience in nursing education, graduate level preferred Must have experience or be willing to teach in the online and on-campus format (typically one weekend per semester) Simulation experience a plus Master of Science Degree in Nursing required National certification in Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Licensed in New Hampshire as an APRN in Adult Gerontology, Acute Care Nurse Practitioner Current or recent clinical experience in the acute care environment (hospitalist role, ICU, ER, specialty care) and on-going commitment to advance practice Doctoral preparation preferred or in progress Supplemental Information Applicants should apply online and include a cover letter along with resume/CV at: https://www.schooljobs.com/careers/rivieredu/jobs/5450927/adjunct-faculty-adult-gerontology-acute-care-nurse-practitioner-track All applications and nominations will be considered highly confidential. Review of applications will begin immediately and continue until the position is filled. Rivier University does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, religion, age, veteran or marital status, sex sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability in admission or access to, treatment in, or employment in its programs and activities, and Title IX requires that the University not discriminate on the bases stated above. This position is not eligible for benefits. Employer Rivier University (NH) Address 420 South Main Street Nashua, New Hampshire, 03060 Phone 603-897-8717 603-897-8211 Website https://www.rivier.edu/ Apply"
